# --- Data -------------------------------------------------------------------
# The raw dataset is ~20 GB, the processed matrix ~340 MB, and the grid
# geojson is a separate large download. None of these belong in git;
# README.md explains how to obtain and rebuild each.
data/raw/
data/raw_synth/
data/processed/
data/processed_synth/
data/grid/
*.npy
*.parquet
!data/.gitkeep

